# members.csv — squadron member roster for role assignments.
# Copy to members.csv (gitignored — contains participant e-mail addresses).
#
# Format: team,identity   (one member per line; `#` = comment; header optional)
#   team     — squadron number, 1-99 (leading zero optional)
#   identity — Entra e-mail (UPN) OR a raw object ID (GUID).
#              E-mail resolution needs directory-read rights on the tenant.
#              Without them, have each member run:
#                  az ad signed-in-user show --query id -o tsv
#              and paste the GUID here instead.
#
# team,identity
1,alex.squadron01@example.com
1,blair.squadron01@example.com
2,charlie.squadron02@example.com
2,9f6c1d2e-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-1234567890ab   # raw object ID also works
